{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":3,"lesson_key":"S2L3","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ","en":"Preposition 'Fii' (In): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ","ur":"حرفِ جر 'فِي' (میں): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-जर्र 'फ़ी' (में): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ"},"arabic_Focus":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ","hinglish_Focus":"Kitaab, Zameen → Kitaab mein, Zameen mein","page_numbers":"56–57","book_page":56,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ","hinglish":"Kitaab, Zameen → Kitaab mein, Zameen mein","arabic_word":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ","arabic_combined":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ","hinglish_word":"Kitaab, Zameen","hinglish_combined":"Kitaab, Zameen → Kitaab mein, Zameen mein","title_en":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 3 (Book Page 56–57)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ","after_ar":"فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ","before_hi":"Kitaab, Zameen","after_hi":"Kitaab mein, Zameen mein"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L3 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L3 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["فِي + الْـ (Zair ـِ)","فِي الْكِتَابِ / فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ","Kitaab mein / Aasmanon aur zameen mein"],["فِي + Nakirah (Do Zair ـٍ)","فِي كِتَابٍ / فِي ضَلَالٍ / فِي شَكٍّ","Ek kitaab mein / Kisi gumraahi mein / Kisi shak mein"],["لَفِي (Yaqeenan ... mein)","لَفِي خُسْرٍ / لَفِي نَعِيمٍ / لَفِي ضَلَالٍ مُبِينٍ","Yaqeenan khasaare mein / Yaqeenan ne'mat mein"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l3_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 3</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr 'Fii' (Mein): الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ (Page 56–57)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr (فِي + ـِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، الْأَرْضُ (Kitaab, Zameen) se فِي الْكِتَابِ ، فِي الْأَرْضِ (Kitaab mein, Zameen mein) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 56–57):** **`فِي`** ka matlab **'mein'** hai. Iske baad aane wale ism ke aakhri harf ke neeche **Zair (`ـِ / ـٍ`)** aati hai: `الْكِتَابُ ← فِي الْكِتَابِ` (Kitaab mein), `فِي كِتَابٍ` (ek kitaab mein), `لَفِي خُسْرٍ` (yaqeenan khasaare mein)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l3_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Niche di gayi misaalein ghaur se dekhiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l3_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar di gayi misaalon se wazeh hai ke (فِي) ka matlab \"mein\" hai, aur iske baad aane wale lafz ke aakhri harf par aam taur par zair (kasrah) hoti hai. (فِي) aur iske baad wala lafz milkar ek phrase banaate hain jinka tarjuma ek saath hota hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l3_r5","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Ab aap khud neeche di gayi Qur'ani ibaarat samjhein aur tarjuma karein:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l3_g6","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l3_g6_w1","arabic":"فِي الدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Deen mein","translations":{"en":"In religion / In the religion","ur":"دین میں","hi":"दीन में / धर्म में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w2","arabic":"فِي الْعِلْمِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعِلْمِ</span>","hinglish":"Ilm mein","translations":{"en":"In knowledge","ur":"علم میں","hi":"इल्म में / ज्ञान में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w3","arabic":"فِي الْكِتَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكِتَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Kitaab mein","translations":{"en":"In the Book","ur":"کتاب میں","hi":"किताब में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w4","arabic":"فِي الْقُرْآنِ","a