:"फ़ितने में / आज़माइश में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w12","arabic":"فِي الْكُفْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكُفْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Kufr mein","translations":{"en":"In disbelief","ur":"کفر میں","hi":"कुफ़्र में / अविश्वास में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w13","arabic":"فِي السَّعِيرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">السَّعِيرِ</span>","hinglish":"Bhadakti aag mein","translations":{"en":"In the blazing Fire (Saeer)","ur":"بھڑکتی آگ میں / سعیر میں","hi":"भड़कती आग में / सईर में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w14","arabic":"فِي الْجَحِيمِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَحِيمِ</span>","hinglish":"Jahannam mein","translations":{"en":"In Hellfire (Jahim)","ur":"جہنم میں / جحیم میں","hi":"जहन्नम में / जहीम में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w15","arabic":"فِي النَّارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">النَّارِ</span>","hinglish":"Aag mein","translations":{"en":"In the Fire","ur":"آگ میں","hi":"आग में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w16","arabic":"فِي الْعَذَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعَذَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Azab mein","translations":{"en":"In the torment / In punishment","ur":"عذاب میں","hi":"अज़ाब में / यातना में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w17","arabic":"فِي الْمِحْرَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمِحْرَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Mehrab mein","translations":{"en":"In the sanctuary / prayer chamber","ur":"محراب میں / عبادت گاہ میں","hi":"मेहराब में / इबादतगाह में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w18","arabic":"فِي الْحَقِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقِّ</span>","hinglish":"Haq mein","translations":{"en":"In the truth","ur":"حق میں / سچائی میں","hi":"हक़ में / सत्य में"}},{"id":"s2l3_g6_w19","arabic":"فِي الْإِنْجِيلِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">فِي</span> <spa